## 3. Restrictions

### 3.1 Commercial Use Prohibited
You may **not** use the Software for any Commercial Purpose without a separate
written commercial license from the Licensor.

### 3.2 Commercial Model Training Prohibited
You may **not** use the Software for Model Training for any Commercial Purpose
without a separate written commercial license from the Licensor. This applies
regardless of whether the Software itself is used directly or as part of a
larger pipeline, and regardless of whether the training is performed by you or
by a third party on your behalf.

### 3.3 No Sublicensing
You may not sublicense, sell, rent, lease, or otherwise transfer the Software
or any rights under this license to any third party. You may not circumvent
the Commercial Purpose restriction by directing a non-commercial third party
to use the Software on your behalf for a Commercial Purpose.

### 3.4 Attribution
You must retain all copyright, patent, and trademark notices in the Software.
If you distribute the Software, you must include a copy of this license.

